* Independently authored ngspice-native TI TPS22986 comparator model.
* Real analog output feedback V(OUT)*vhys controls the switching decision.
* Native u() expression and physical RC network, not copied vendor E IF.
.subckt SR_TI_COMP_HYS OUT INP INN PARAMS: vhys=.05 td=0 tt=2n
Bcondition stage 0 V=u(v(INP)+v(OUT)*vhys-v(INN))
Rdrive stage OUT 10
Coutput OUT 0 {(td+0.5*tt)/6.93}
.ends SR_TI_COMP_HYS
